    "enUS": {
      "description": "Do you know Sven? Now, there is a man who does the work of the Light! He and his followers keep a camp at the northwestern edge of Duskwood.\n\nUnfortunately, because they are so few, they cannot even spare a man to fetch supplies from town. Will you deliver these supplies to him?",
      "summary": "Deliver the supplies to Sven.",
      "title": "Deliveries to Sven",
      "translationMetadata": {
